<rml>
<head>
	<title>Skirmish</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/menu.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/match.rcss"/>
</head>
<!--
Skirmish (CreateMatchPage.tsx's OfflineBotsPage with MapBrowser.tsx): a mode, an arena, how many bots
and their skill. Its state is create_match.skirmish, the map browser's create_match_pick.skirmish
(fit: the mode's map type, mapi: the arena's index in the engine's maps), in ui/data/create_match.json.

The map browser lists the arenas made for the mode first, then the ones made for the other modes
(picking one of those switches to the first mode it's made for). There is no search: RmlUi's data
expressions can't look into a name. A mode change keeps the arena when it's made for the new mode,
else picks the mode's own (modes[].pick): the arrows and the value run that themselves, Left and
Right spin in C++ and the key's release checks. RmlUi's expressions have no loops, so the checks
over an arena's types (up to six) are written out; they were generated, so keep their shape.

Fight: the button's click works out the lineup, the fight wrapper's click (after it, as the click
bubbles) starts the match with startmatch create_match.skirmish, puts you in a team in the team
modes (q3_ui's "team"), and sets back the cvars a custom match may have changed. The lineup is the
arena's own bots (arenas.txt), then the engine's bots in their order, skipping the arena's, up to
the count (one in a duel): k0..k6 are the arena's bots in lower case, d is whether bots[j] is one
of them, c how many of the first j were, and bots.m0..m6, f0..f17 are the names startmatch adds
('' is no bot).
-->
<body data-model="menu">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="corners"><div class="tl"/><div class="tr"/><div class="bl"/><div class="br"/></div>
		<div class="topline"/>
		<div class="phead">
			<div><banner text="Skirmish"/><p class="subtitle">Pick a mode and an arena; the map's own bots come first, as in the original game's single-player tiers.</p></div>
			<div class="backbtn" onclick="back"><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>Back</span></div>
		</div>
		<div class="divider"/>
		<div class="pbody">
			<div class="cols">
				<div class="main">
					<div class="browser">
						<div class="mbar">
							<span class="chip on">All<span class="n">{{ maps.size }}</span></span>
							<span class="hint">Arenas made for {{ create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name }} come first</span>
						</div>
						<div class="cards">
							<div class="grid">
								<button class="card" data-for="m, i : maps" data-if="(m.types.size &gt; 0 ? (m.types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 1 ? (m.types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 2 ? (m.types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 3 ? (m.types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 4 ? (m.types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 5 ? (m.types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)" data-class-sel="i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-attrif-autofocus="i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-event-click="create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = i">
									<div class="img" data-style-decorator="'linear-gradient(0deg, #000000e6 0%, #00000033 50%, #00000000 100%)' + (m.shot != '' ? ', image(' + m.shot + ' fill)' : '')"/>
									<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ m.name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ m.map }}</div></div>
								</button>
							</div>
							<div class="othersh">Made for other modes than {{ create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name }}: picking one switches the mode</div>
							<div class="grid">
								<button class="card" data-for="m, i : maps" data-if="(m.types.size &gt; 0 ? (m.types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 1 ? (m.types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 2 ? (m.types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 3 ? (m.types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 4 ? (m.types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 5 ? (m.types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? false : (m.types.size &gt; 0 ? (m.types[0] == 'ffa' || m.types[0] == 'tourney' || m.types[0] == 'team' || m.types[0] == 'ctf' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 1 ? (m.types[1] == 'ffa' || m.types[1] == 'tourney' || m.types[1] == 'team' || m.types[1] == 'ctf' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 2 ? (m.types[2] == 'ffa' || m.types[2] == 'tourney' || m.types[2] == 'team' || m.types[2] == 'ctf' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 3 ? (m.types[3] == 'ffa' || m.types[3] == 'tourney' || m.types[3] == 'team' || m.types[3] == 'ctf' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 4 ? (m.types[4] == 'ffa' || m.types[4] == 'tourney' || m.types[4] == 'team' || m.types[4] == 'ctf' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 5 ? (m.types[5] == 'ffa' || m.types[5] == 'tourney' || m.types[5] == 'team' || m.types[5] == 'ctf' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)" data-class-sel="i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-attrif-autofocus="i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-event-click="create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = i; create_match.skirmish.mi = (m.types.size &gt; 0 ? (m.types[0] == 'ffa' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 1 ? (m.types[1] == 'ffa' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 2 ? (m.types[2] == 'ffa' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 3 ? (m.types[3] == 'ffa' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 4 ? (m.types[4] == 'ffa' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 5 ? (m.types[5] == 'ffa' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 0 : (m.types.size &gt; 0 ? (m.types[0] == 'tourney' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 1 ? (m.types[1] == 'tourney' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 2 ? (m.types[2] == 'tourney' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 3 ? (m.types[3] == 'tourney' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 4 ? (m.types[4] == 'tourney' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 5 ? (m.types[5] == 'tourney' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 1 : (m.types.size &gt; 0 ? (m.types[0] == 'team' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 1 ? (m.types[1] == 'team' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 2 ? (m.types[2] == 'team' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 3 ? (m.types[3] == 'team' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 4 ? (m.types[4] == 'team' ? true : (m.types.size &gt; 5 ? (m.types[5] == 'team' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 2 : 3; create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit">
									<div class="img" data-style-decorator="'linear-gradient(0deg, #000000e6 0%, #00000033 50%, #00000000 100%)' + (m.shot != '' ? ', image(' + m.shot + ' fill)' : '')"/>
									<div class="fits"><span data-for="t : m.types" data-if="t == 'ffa' || t == 'tourney' || t == 'team' || t == 'ctf'">{{ t == 'ffa' ? 'Free For All' : t == 'tourney' ? 'Duel' : t == 'team' ? 'Team Deathmatch' : 'Capture the Flag' }}</span></div>
									<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ m.name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ m.map }}</div></div>
								</button>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="side">
					<div class="preview">
						<div data-if="maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi">
							<div class="img" data-style-decorator="maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].shot != '' ? 'image(' + maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].shot + ' fill)' : 'none'"/>
							<div class="fade"/>
							<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].map }}</div></div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="section"><span class="t">Mode</span><span class="rule"/></div>
					<div id="sk_mode" class="spinner wide modespin" spin="create_match.skirmish.mi" options="0|1|2|3" data-event-keyup="create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = (maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi : create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].pick">
						<span class="arrow" onclick="sound move" data-event-click="create_match.skirmish.mi = create_match.skirmish.mi &gt; 0 ? create_match.skirmish.mi - 1 : 3; create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = (maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi : create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].pick">&lt;</span>
						<span class="v" onclick="sound move" data-event-click="create_match.skirmish.mi = create_match.skirmish.mi &lt; 3 ? create_match.skirmish.mi + 1 : 0; create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = (maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi : create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].pick">{{ create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name }}</span>
						<span class="arrow" onclick="sound move" data-event-click="create_match.skirmish.mi = create_match.skirmish.mi &lt; 3 ? create_match.skirmish.mi + 1 : 0; create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = (maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi : create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].pick">&gt;</span>
					</div>
					<div data-if="create_match.skirmish.mi != 1">
						<div class="section"><span class="t">Bots</span><span class="rule"/></div>
						<div class="slrow"><input type="range" class="slider" min="1" max="11" step="1" data-value="create_match.skirmish.count"/><span class="val">{{ create_match.skirmish.count }}</span></div>
					</div>
					<div class="section"><span class="t">Skill</span><span class="rule"/></div>
					<div class="spinner wide" spin="create_match.skirmish.skill" options="1|2|3|4|5">
						<span class="arrow prev">&lt;</span><span class="v">{{ create_match.skills[create_match.skirmish.skill - 1] }}</span><span class="arrow next">&gt;</span>
					</div>
					<div class="grow"/>
					<p class="warn" data-if="!(maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false)">{{ create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name }} needs an arena made for it: pick one of the first ones.</p>
					<div class="fightwrap" data-attr-onclick="(maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? 'cmd set g_quadfactor 3; cmd set g_weaponrespawn 5; cmd set g_friendlyFire 0; cmd set g_doWarmup ' + (create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].rules.warmup &gt; 0 ? 1 : 0) + '; cmd set g_warmup ' + create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].rules.warmup + '; startmatch create_match.skirmish' + (create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].team ? '; append wait 5; append team auto' : '') : 'sound buzz; toast ' + create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name + ' needs an arena made for it'">
						<button id="sk_fight" class="btn primary fight" data-event-click="create_match.skirmish.map = maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].map; create_match.skirmish.n = create_match.skirmish.mi == 1 ? 1 : create_match.skirmish.count * 1; create_match.skirmish.nmb = maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots.size; create_match.skirmish.k0 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 0 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[0]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.k1 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 1 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[1]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.k2 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 2 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[2]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.k3 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 3 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[3]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.k4 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 4 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[4]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.k5 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 5 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[5]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.k6 = create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 6 ? to_lower(maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[6]) : '-'; create_match.skirmish.bots.m0 = create_match.skirmish.n &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 0 ? maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[0] : ''; create_match.skirmish.bots.m1 = create_match.skirmish.n &gt; 1 &amp;&amp; create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 1 ? maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[1] : ''; create_match.skirmish.bots.m2 = create_match.skirmish.n &gt; 2 &amp;&amp; create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 2 ? maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[2] : ''; create_match.skirmish.bots.m3 = create_match.skirmish.n &gt; 3 &amp;&amp; create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 3 ? maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[3] : ''; create_match.skirmish.bots.m4 = create_match.skirmish.n &gt; 4 &amp;&amp; create_match.skirmish.nmb &gt; 4 ? maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].bots[4] : ''; creat